Package: siemstress
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.12), systemd
Suggests: siemstress-gui, siemstress-tui
Description: lightweight SIEM for homelabs
 SIEMstress collects logs from the systemd journal, syslog senders on the
 network, log files and the Docker or Podman API; normalizes authentication,
 privilege, account, audit and firewall events; raises alerts from detection
 rules tagged with MITRE ATT&CK techniques; and provides a case workflow
 (disposition, actions taken, activity log) for working them to a close.

