Description: lightweight SIEM for homelabs - desktop dashboard
 Qt desktop dashboard for SIEMstress, with tray notifications for new alerts.

Package: siemstress-tui
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, siemstress (= ${source:Version}), python3-textual
Description: lightweight SIEM for homelabs - terminal dashboard
 Terminal dashboard for SIEMstress, usable over SSH on headless hosts.
